<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus reverse repo auction yield at 5.73 pct.</title>
<headline>Cyprus reverse repo auction yield at 5.73 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on a reverse repo auction of 14-day Cypriot t-bills was 5.73 percent, up 0.16 points from the previous central bank auction on October 30.</p>
<p>Commercial banks under-subscribed the Wednesday auction, submitting bids for bills worth 20 million pounds for the 30 million pounds worth on offer. The highest yield accepted was 6 percent and the lowest 5.50 percent.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
